{
  "$comment": "The telemetry each Semiont service exports over OTLP, in any language: every span and metric, the services that export it, its kind, and the attributes it carries. A service exports the rows that list it and no others. Each service's conformance suite holds it to this table from outside, in both directions: every span and metric its observability cases receive must be a row listing the service, of the listed kind, carrying only listed attribute keys (and, where a row lists values, only those values); and every row listing it whose `when` is `export` or `traffic` must arrive, with every attribute not marked `only`. `when`: `export` — whenever export is on; `traffic` — once the service's observability cases' traffic has run; `supervised` — only under the supervisor (SUPERVISE_EVENTS and SUPERVISE_NAME set), checked by the environment cases; `fatal` — only on a fatal error, which no case causes. `planes`, where given, names the only signal planes a gateway row arrives on. `sdk` names the services that reach the bus through an SDK, and for each the SDK transports it uses, or, of a transport it uses part of, the rows it exports, by name: such a service also exports the rows specs/src/sdk-telemetry/telemetry.json lists for those transports, and those rows, and its suite holds it to both tables as one. In a span name, `{channel}` is the bus channel. `{jobType}` is the job's type. Span kinds are OTLP's; a metric's `instrument` is `counter` (a monotonic sum), `up-down counter` (a non-monotonic sum), `gauge` or `histogram`.",
  "sdk": {
    "dispatcher": [
      "bus"
    ],
    "archivist": [
      "bus"
    ],
    "worker": [
      "bus",
      "content.put",
      "content.get"
    ]
  },
  "spans": [
    {
      "name": "bus.dispatch:{channel}",
      "services": [
        "gateway"
      ],
      "kind": "server",
      "when": "traffic",
      "meaning": "An emit the gateway accepted, in the caller's trace when the request carried one.",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "key": "bus.channel"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "sse.deliver:{channel}",
      "services": [
        "gateway"
      ],
      "kind": "producer",
      "when": "traffic",
